title: Motion Tracker Lab
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-03
abstract: >-
  A browser-based physics video analysis tool for manually tracking the
  motion of objects in uploaded videos, replicating core features of
  desktop tools like Tracker entirely client-side.
